            4. <strong>Result:</strong> Perfectly circular, uniform thickness puri that peels off effortlessly and puffs like a balloon in hot oil!`,
            productCard: PRODUCTS.puri,
            chips: ['🥟 Buy 2 for ₹999', '🚚 Free COD Delivery', '🛡️ 7-Day Guarantee']
          };
        }

        // Check if asking about making rotis/chapatis
        if (hasAny('roti', 'chapati', 'phulka', 'fulka', 'paratha')) {
          return {
            text: `Yes! You can definitely press raw dough for <strong>Rotis, Chapatis, Puris, and Khakhras</strong> with this SUS-304 Stainless Steel Press. 👍<br><br>
            <em>Please note:</em> This is a heavy-duty mechanical cold press to shape dough quickly in seconds without a rolling pin (belan). After pressing the thin round shape, you cook/puff it on your standard kitchen tawa or frying pan!`,
            productCard: PRODUCTS.puri,
            chips: ['🥟 Order Puri Press (₹599)', '🎁 Buy 2 at ₹999 Deal', '🚚 Check COD']
          };
        }

        // Check if asking about material/rust/cleaning
        if (hasAny('rust', 'clean', 'wash', 'steel', 'material', 'grade', 'weight', 'size', 'diameter', 'inch')) {
          return {
            text: `The <strong>Zenkart Puri &amp; Khakhra Press</strong> is engineered with:<br>
            • <strong>Food-Grade SUS-304 Stainless Steel:</strong> 100% rust-proof, non-toxic, and hygienic.<br>
            • <strong>6.5-Inch Mirror Plates:</strong> Ideal diameter for standard Indian puris, tacos, and papads.<br>
            • <strong>Silicone Anti-Slip Base:</strong> Sturdy grip that stays planted on marble and granite kitchen countertops.<br>
            • <strong>Maintenance:</strong> Simple rinse with warm soapy water and wipe dry with a soft cloth.`,
            productCard: PRODUCTS.puri,
            chips: ['🥟 Buy 2 for ₹999', '🎁 View Combos', '🚚 Delivery Details']
          };
        }

        // General puri overview
        return {
          text: `The <strong>Stainless Steel Puri &amp; Khakhra Press Maker</strong> (₹599) cuts preparation time from 30 minutes down to under 5 minutes! Crafted from mirror-polished heavy SUS-304 stainless steel with an ergonomic leverage handle and anti-slip silicone rubber base.<br><br>
          🔥 <strong>Best Offer:</strong> Buy 2 for only <strong>₹999</strong> (Save ₹199) with Free Cash on Delivery!`,
          productCard: PRODUCTS.puri,
          chips: ['🥟 Buy 2 for ₹999 (Most Popular)', '🥟 Buy 1 for ₹599', '👨‍🍳 Non-stick tips']
        };
      }

      // 8. SPECIFIC JAAP COUNTER QUESTIONS
      if (hasAny('jaap', 'jap', 'tasbih', 'tasbeeh', 'counter', 'mantra', 'chant', 'chanting', 'zikr', 'compass', 'tassel', 'mala', 'bead', 'beads')) {
        CONTEXT.lastTopic = 'jaap';

        // Check battery/charging questions
        if (hasAny('battery', 'cell', 'charge', 'charging', 'power', 'replace battery', 'how long')) {
          return {
            text: `🔋 <strong>Battery &amp; Power Specs:</strong><br><br>
            • <strong>Pre-installed Battery:</strong> Comes with a long-life high-grade AG13 button battery already installed inside.<br>
            • <strong>Lifespan:</strong> Runs for 12+ months with regular daily chanting (ultra-low power LCD circuitry).<br>
            • <strong>Replacement:</strong> When needed, the battery hatch opens easily with a standard coin or small screwdriver, and uses widely available replacement cells.`,
            productCard: PRODUCTS.jaap,
            chips: ['📿 Buy 2 for ₹899', '🔇 Is it silent?', '🧭 Compass calibration']
          };
        }

        // Check sound / silent questions
        if (hasAny('sound', 'noise', 'silent', 'click', 'beep', 'quiet', 'loud', 'disturb')) {
          return {
            text: `🔇 <strong>100% Completely Silent Operation:</strong><br><br>
            Unlike mechanical clickers that make a loud "click-clack" noise, our Digital Jaap Counter features an <strong>ultra-smooth silent rubberized roller wheel</strong>. You can chant peacefully in quiet temples, bedtime meditation, trains, or family rooms with zero distraction or clicking sounds.`,
            productCard: PRODUCTS.jaap,
            chips: ['📿 Buy 2 for ₹899', '🎁 View Combos', '🚚 Check Free COD']
          };
        }

        // Check compass or reset
        if (hasAny('compass', 'direction', 'qibla', 'reset', 'how to count', 'screen', 'lcd')) {
          return {
            text: `📿 <strong>Features &amp; Controls:</strong><br><br>
            • <strong>LCD Digital Screen:</strong> Tracks up to 99,999 chants with a single touch.<br>
            • <strong>Recessed Reset Button:</strong> One-press instant reset to 00000 designed so it won't accidentally reset in your pocket.<br>
