            • <strong>Sacred Red Silk Tassel:</strong> Traditional aesthetic finish for secure grip during long prayer sessions.`,
            productCard: PRODUCTS.jaap,
            chips: ['📿 Buy 2 for ₹899 (Best Value)', '📿 Buy 1 for ₹499', '🚚 Free COD']
          };
        }

        // General jaap overview
        return {
          text: `The <strong>Wooden Digital Jaap Counter</strong> (₹499) brings serene mindfulness to your daily sadhana. Features a smooth silent roller, high-contrast LCD (0–99,999 counts), built-in prayer direction compass, and rich carved wood grain finish.<br><br>
          🔥 <strong>Best Offer:</strong> Buy 2 for only <strong>₹899</strong> (Save ₹99) — great gift for parents and elders!`,
          productCard: PRODUCTS.jaap,
          chips: ['📿 Buy 2 for ₹899 (Most Bought)', '📿 Buy 1 for ₹499', '🔇 Is it silent?']
        };
      }

