            💡 <strong>Special Combo:</strong> Buy 2 for <strong>₹999</strong> (Save ₹199) or Buy 3 for <strong>₹1,399</strong> (Save ₹398). Includes Free Express Shipping &amp; Cash on Delivery!`,
