          • <strong>₹0 Advance Payment:</strong> You don't need to enter card details or pay a single rupee online right now.<br>
          • <strong>Inspect &amp; Pay:</strong> Simply hand cash or UPI scan to the courier delivery partner when the sealed parcel reaches your doorstep.<br>
          • <strong>Online Options:</strong> We also accept UPI (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm) and Cards at checkout if you prefer cashless prepaid delivery.`,
          chips: ['🚚 Delivery timeline', '🎁 View Best Offers', '🛡️ 7-Day Guarantee']
        };
      }

      // 11. SHIPPING & DELIVERY TIMELINE
      if (hasAny('shipping', 'delivery', 'time', 'how long', 'days', 'courier', 'charge', 'fee', 'free delivery', 'when will i get', 'fast', 'express', 'pincode')) {
        CONTEXT.lastTopic = 'shipping';
        return {
          text: `🚚 <strong>Pan-India Express Shipping Policy:</strong><br><br>
          • <strong>Free Shipping:</strong> 100% Free Express Air Delivery on every single order (no minimum purchase limit).<br>
          • <strong>Fast Dispatch:</strong> Packed and dispatched from our central warehouse within 24 to 48 hours.<br>
          • <strong>Delivery Time:</strong> Usually takes <strong>3 to 5 business days</strong> to reach metro cities and tier-2/tier-3 towns.<br>
          • <strong>Courier Partners:</strong> Shipped via premium insured couriers: BlueDart, Delhivery, and Xpressbees.`,
          chips: ['📍 Track order', '🚚 Free COD available?', '🎁 Combo Deals']
        };
      }

      // 12. RETURNS, REPLACEMENT & WARRANTY
      if (hasAny('return', 'refund', 'replace', 'replacement', 'broken', 'damaged', 'defect', 'guarantee', 'warranty', 'fake', 'original', 'legit', 'trust')) {
        CONTEXT.lastTopic = 'guarantee';
        return {
          text: `🛡️ <strong>7-Day Hassle-Free Replacement Guarantee:</strong><br><br>
          • <strong>Transit Protection:</strong> Every parcel is packed with multi-layer bubble wrap. If your item arrives defective, damaged, or broken in transit, we've got you covered.<br>
          • <strong>Quick Process:</strong> Just send a 10-second WhatsApp video or photo to our support team within 7 days of delivery.<br>
          • <strong>Zero Questions Replacement:</strong> We immediately dispatch a brand-new replacement parcel to your address at ₹0 extra cost.`,
          chips: ['💬 Contact Support', '🚚 Shipping details', '🎁 View Offers']
        };
      }

      // 13. TRACK ORDER
      if (hasAny('track', 'tracking', 'status', 'where is my order', 'awb', 'consignment')) {
        return {
          text: `📦 <strong>Order Tracking:</strong><br><br>
          As soon as your parcel is dispatched from our warehouse, you will receive an automated <strong>SMS and WhatsApp message containing your live tracking link</strong> and AWB courier number.<br><br>
          Need an update on an existing order? Simply share your Order Number or phone number with our WhatsApp support desk!`,
          chips: ['💬 WhatsApp Support', '🚚 Delivery timelines', '🎁 View Products']
        };
      }

      // 14. TALK TO HUMAN / WHATSAPP / CONTACT
      if (hasAny('human', 'agent', 'person', 'whatsapp', 'call', 'contact', 'phone', 'support', 'customer care', 'email')) {
        return {
          text: `📞 <strong>Direct Human Customer Support:</strong><br><br>
          Our friendly customer care team is available on WhatsApp and phone Monday through Saturday (10 AM – 7 PM IST).<br><br>
          • <strong>WhatsApp Helpline:</strong> Instant order assistance and replacements.<br>
          • <strong>Email:</strong> support@zenkart.in`,
          action: 'whatsapp_support',
          chips: ['💬 Open WhatsApp Chat', '🚚 Delivery info', '🎁 View Combos']
        };
      }

      // 15. REVIEWS & CUSTOMER SATISFACTION
      if (hasAny('review', 'reviews', 'rating', 'ratings', 'feedback', 'people say', 'customer')) {
        return {
          text: `⭐ <strong>Verified Indian Shopper Ratings:</strong><br><br>
          • <strong>Wooden Digital Jaap Counter:</strong> 4.9★ from <strong>184 verified reviews</strong>. Customers praise the silent roller and rich wood finish.<br>
          • <strong>Stainless Steel Puri Press:</strong> 4.8★ from <strong>241 verified reviews</strong>. Loved for cutting morning cooking time to under 5 minutes.<br><br>
          You can read all reviews with customer locations and dates directly on our catalog page!`,
          chips: ['📿 Jaap Counter Reviews', '🥟 Puri Press Reviews', '🎁 Combo Offers']
        };
      }

      // 16. CONVERSATIONAL FALLBACK (SMART & EMPATHETIC)
      const suggestions = [
        `I want to make sure I get you the exact details you need! Are you looking for specs on our <strong>Wooden Jaap Counter</strong> (₹499), the <strong>Stainless Steel Puri Maker</strong> (₹599), our <strong>Buy 2/Buy 3 Combo Savings</strong>, or <strong>Free Cash on Delivery</strong>?`,
        `I'm here to assist! Could you tell me if you'd like to explore our spiritual meditation tools, kitchen essentials, or check our delivery times and discount bundles?`,
        `Got it! Feel free to ask me anything specific—like <em>"Can the puri maker make rotis?"</em>, <em>"How long does the Jaap counter battery last?"</em>, or <em>"What are the combo offers?"</em>`
      ];

      return {
        text: suggestions[Math.floor(Math.random() * suggestions.length)],
        chips: ['📿 Jaap Counter Specs', '🥟 Puri Press Details', '🎁 View Combo Savings', '🚚 Free COD & Shipping']
      };
    }

    // Window toggle
    window.toggleZenkartAiChat = function() {
      const win = document.getElementById('zenkart-ai-window');
      if(!win) return;
      if (win.classList.contains('is-closed')) {
        win.classList.remove('is-closed');
        win.classList.add('is-open');
        setTimeout(() => document.getElementById('zenkart-ai-input')?.focus(), 250);
      } else {
        win.classList.remove('is-open');
        win.classList.add('is-closed');
      }
    };

    // Quick prompt sender
    window.sendQuickPrompt = function(text) {
      if (text === '🎁 Open Bundle Selector Modal' || text === '🎁 Open Bundle Deals Modal') {
        if (typeof window.openBundleSelectorModal === 'function') {
          window.openBundleSelectorModal();
          return;
        }
      }
      const input = document.getElementById('zenkart-ai-input');
      if(input) {
        input.value = text;
        document.getElementById('zenkart-ai-form')?.dispatchEvent(new Event('submit', { cancelable: true }));
      }
    };

    // Clear chat
    window.clearZenkartAiChat = function() {
      const container = document.getElementById('zenkart-ai-messages');
      if(!container) return;
      container.innerHTML = `
        <div class="zenkart-msg-bubble" style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;">
          <div style="width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: #222; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 12px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;">✨</div>
          <div style="background: #151515; border: 1px solid #282828; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 14px; border-top-left-radius: 2px; max-width: 86%; color: #e5e5e5;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 6px;">Chat cleared! How can I assist you right now?</p>
            <div style="font-size: 10.5px; color: #777;">Ask about products, bundles, or delivery.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      `;
      updateChips(['📿 Jaap Counter', '🥟 Puri Press', '🎁 Combo Deals', '🚚 Free COD']);
    };

    // Dynamic chips updater
    function updateChips(chipsArray) {
      const chipsContainer = document.getElementById('zenkart-chips-container');
      if (!chipsContainer || !chipsArray || !chipsArray.length) return;
      chipsContainer.innerHTML = '';
      chipsArray.forEach(chip => {
        const btn = document.createElement('button');
        btn.className = 'zenkart-chip-btn';
        btn.textContent = chip;
        btn.onclick = () => window.sendQuickPrompt(chip);
        chipsContainer.appendChild(btn);
      });
    }

    // Append message with animation
    function appendMessage(sender, html, productCard = null, action = null) {
      const container = document.getElementById('zenkart-ai-messages');
      if (!container) return;

      const msgDiv = document.createElement('div');
      msgDiv.className = 'zenkart-msg-bubble';
      msgDiv.style.display = 'flex';
      msgDiv.style.alignItems = 'flex-start';

      let cardHtml = '';
      if (productCard) {
        cardHtml = `
          <div style="margin-top: 10px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; background: #000; border: 1px solid #333; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
              <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #fff; font-size: 12px;">${productCard.title}</span>
              <span style="color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px;">${productCard.priceSingle}</span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 10px; color: #999;">${productCard.badge}</div>
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; margin-top: 2px;">
              <button 
                type="button" 
                onclick="if(window.openBundleSelectorModal){window.openBundleSelectorModal('${productCard.handle}');}else if(window.ZenkartCart){window.ZenkartCart.buyNow('${productCard.handle}', 1);}" 
                style="background: #ffffff; color: #000000; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 11px; border: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 4px;">
                ⚡ 1-Click Buy
              </button>
              <button 
                type="button" 
                onclick="if(window.ZenkartCart){window.ZenkartCart.add('${productCard.handle}', 1);}" 
                style="background: #1c1c1c; color: #fff; border: 1px solid #3a3a3a; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 11px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 4px;">
                🛒 Add Basket
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        `;
      } else if (action === 'open_bundle_modal') {
        cardHtml = `
          <div style="margin-top: 10px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; background: #141414; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
              <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #f59e0b; font-size: 11.5px;">🎁 Combo Savings Activated</span>
              <span style="font-size: 10px; background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); color: #fbbf24; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700;">SAVE UP TO ₹398</span>
            </div>
            <button 
              type="button" 
              onclick="if(window.openBundleSelectorModal){window.openBundleSelectorModal();}" 
              style="width: 100%; background: #ffffff; color: #000; font-weight: 800; padding: 9px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; border: none; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);">
              ✨ Open Interactive Bundle Selector
            </button>
          </div>
        `;
      } else if (action === 'whatsapp_support') {
        cardHtml = `
          <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
            <a 
              href="https://wa.me/919876543210?text=Hello%20Zenkart%20Support,%20I%20need%20help%20with%20an%20order" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer" 
              style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; width: 100%; background: #25d366; color: #000; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; text-decoration: none;">
              <span>💬</span>
              <span>Open WhatsApp Support Chat</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        `;
      }

      if (sender === 'user') {
        msgDiv.style.justifyContent = 'flex-end';
        msgDiv.innerHTML = `
          <div style="background: #ffffff; color: #000000; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 14px; border-top-right-radius: 2px; max-width: 84%; font-weight: 500; font-size: 12.5px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
            ${html}
          </div>
        `;
      } else {
        msgDiv.style.justifyContent = 'flex-start';
        msgDiv.style.gap = '10px';
        msgDiv.innerHTML = `
          <div style="width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: #222; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 12px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;">✨</div>
          <div style="background: #151515; border: 1px solid #282828; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 14px; border-top-left-radius: 2px; max-width: 86%; color: #e5e5e5;">
            <div style="margin: 0;">${html}</div>
            ${cardHtml}
          </div>
        `;
      }

      container.appendChild(msgDiv);
      container.scrollTop = container.scrollHeight;
    }

    // Show / Hide Typing Indicator
    function showTypingIndicator() {
      const container = document.getElementById('zenkart-ai-messages');
      if (!container) return;

      const typingDiv = document.createElement('div');
      typingDiv.id = 'zenkart-ai-typing-indicator';
      typingDiv.style.display = 'flex';
      typingDiv.style.alignItems = 'center';
      typingDiv.style.gap = '10px';
      typingDiv.innerHTML = `
        <div style="width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: #222; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 12px; flex-shrink: 0;">✨</div>
        <div style="background: #151515; border: 1px solid #282828; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 14px; border-top-left-radius: 2px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;">
          <span class="zenkart-typing-dot"></span>
          <span class="zenkart-typing-dot"></span>
          <span class="zenkart-typing-dot"></span>
        </div>
      `;
      container.appendChild(typingDiv);
      container.scrollTop = container.scrollHeight;
    }

    function removeTypingIndicator() {
      const el = document.getElementById('zenkart-ai-typing-indicator');
      if (el) el.remove();
    }

    // Form submission handler
    window.handleUserMessage = function(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      const input = document.getElementById('zenkart-ai-input');
      const query = input?.value.trim();
      if (!query) return;

      // 1. Render User message
      appendMessage('user', query);
      input.value = '';
      CONTEXT.turnCount++;

      // 2. Show realistic typing delay
      showTypingIndicator();

      // Dynamic thinking delay (350ms - 650ms) for natural conversational feel
      const delay = Math.min(650, Math.max(350, query.length * 15));

      setTimeout(() => {
        removeTypingIndicator();
        const response = generateSmartResponse(query);
        appendMessage('ai', response.text, response.productCard || null, response.action || null);

        // Update live contextual chips
        if (response.chips && response.chips.length) {
          updateChips(response.chips);
        }
      }, delay);
    };
  })();
</script>
